@macro{TITLE}{ Definition Lists }
@require{amestd}
@begin

The following is a regular definition list:

@deflist{
    @item{First} It is the first item.
    @item{Second} And there is a second item.
}

Also a thin definition list:

@deflist/thin{
    @item{Third} Number III.
    @item{Fourth} Number IV.
}
